The portal was first built in partnership with the City Government of Naga and the Naga City
People's Council, for the Naga City People's Budget Reform Project led by WeSolve Foundation.
A deployment keeps this credit on its "Source code" and licence pages.

Data and third-party material

- The sample city under api/prisma/data/sample-city is drawn from a city's published Annual
  Investment Program, with every place name removed. It is sample data, not a real budget.
- api/prisma/data/naga-barangays.json and client/public/geo/naga-barangays.topo.json are Naga
  City's barangays, from the Philippine Statistics Authority (2020 census) and HDX COD-AB (CC BY-IGO).
  They serve the Data Explorer's map until a deployment supplies its own.
- The climate typology, chart of accounts, PAP sectors, SDG goals, SGLG indicators and UACS objects
  under api/prisma/data are public reference lists of the Philippine government and the United Nations.
